=\"legal-toc-num\">02.</span> Advertising</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#d-3\"><span class=\"legal-toc-num\">03.</span> Content accuracy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#d-4\"><span class=\"legal-toc-num\">04.</span> No professional advice</a></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"legal-content-main\">\n<div class=\"section-card\" id=\"d-1\" style=\"\">\n<section class=\"legal-section\">\n<h2 class=\"legal-section-title\"><span class=\"legal-num\">01</span>Affiliate links</h2>\n<div class=\"legal-section-body\">Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click through and make a purchase, I may earn a commission at <strong>no additional cost</strong> to you.</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-card\" id=\"d-2\" style=\"margin-top:var(--sp-6)\">\n<section class=\"legal-section\">\n<h2 class=\"legal-section-title\"><span class=\"legal-num\">02</span>Advertising</h2>\n<div class=\"legal-section-body\">This site displays advertisements via third-party ad networks. Ad placements are clearly labeled and never interrupt content.</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 3. ad slot ═══ -->\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--in-content\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-336x280-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"336\" height=\"280\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-inc